{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "020e843f3da5ec2120875eba33ed00fc8e2516d2b35593d2ee9fb2fabc7e51e1", "ja": "夜に輝く星座のように", "zh": "如同夜空中闪耀的星座一般", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "54d536b64767f93e3c6a58fd486642a629ad418d46d146571e91ffd85f5a2f5e", "ja": "レッスンも終盤を迎えた奈緒と亜利沙。\nなんとなくポエマーなプロデューサーの提案\nで屋上に上がって夜空を見上げ、輝く星座の\nようにアイドルも永遠なのだと語り合った後\n亜利沙はついに奈緒をハグするのだった。", "zh": "课程也接近尾声的奈绪和亚利沙。在制作人那有点诗意的提议下，两人登上屋顶仰望夜空，谈论着偶像也如闪耀的星座般永恒。之后，亚利沙终于拥抱了奈绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca6ec3a37fbd321c677002e8abdc4c06a235c54952ff11985c86c83f75b3c2ad", "ja": "（レッスンも終盤だ。亜利沙も奈緒も、曲の理解度が\n深まり、良い公演になりそうだ……）", "zh": "（练习也接近尾声了。亜利沙和奈绪对歌曲的理解都更深了，看来会成为一场精彩的公演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4f7664360df59ce211b0fee26c25cf171d17480f248ada46e70b7e4751b16d40", "ja": "よし、ふたりとも。今日はこのへんにしておこう。", "zh": "好，你们两个。今天就练到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "78c038416d63137b1a19345b88a61f22d346bfc3e9bf11199ea12caa0462c2c3", "ja": "すごく良くなってきたな。なんだか悲しみを乗り越えた\n先にあるものが見えてきたというか……。", "zh": "越来越好了。总觉得，我好像看到了跨越悲伤之后的景象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "0d0a01053dcdded8e8e45f16fb59d5cb182adf518d2af281bb2529b66dc4f0da", "ja": "あはは、そんな大層なもん見えてんのかな。\n{$P$}さん、ポエマーですね！", "zh": "啊哈哈，真有你说得那么夸张吗？{$P$}先生，你还真是个诗人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d9b2fff4c25c170675ae80af1fef1b97d3bad7f7f8a52ce8ee82e099c054d124", "ja": "あはは、そうかもな。\nでも、本当にそう思うんだ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，也许吧。\n不过，我确实是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "8474997117b7f2543879327a2d0824b8e158534c50a21cbf2ceb3459f308772e", "ja": "まあ、亜利沙は悲しい思いを乗り越える出来事が\nあったからかもしれへんけど。", "zh": "不过，这或许也是因为亚利沙经历过\n跨越悲伤的事情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "28058397c6eb39b7518c1d93444f3d5180cd7a58a9b0c9dc2ab36b1072c0f59d", "ja": "乗り越えられたのは、奈緒ちゃんたちのおかげですよ！\n大好きです！　すう～～♪", "zh": "能克服过来，都是多亏了奈绪她们哦！\n最喜欢你们了！吸～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "761e16bda5787ac671bdbceb4409e3b61cd07ac9e1439c068a040918d3821a93", "ja": "ああもう、いちいちひっつこうとせえへんのっ！", "zh": "真是的，别老是一个劲儿地往我身上贴啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c5d2afca5225a741e12adbde0a47ca95810fb52f46532515973111b42152fd5", "ja": "いえ、身体が勝手に吸い寄せられまして！　すう～♪", "zh": "不，是身体不由自主地被吸过去了！呼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6190225abfd4b05f88ecefba6a1ff575ab364124bb5e89913d88885be19f7bca", "ja": "あー、ところで、さっき外に出たら、夜空がすごく\n綺麗だったんだ。休憩がてら、屋上に行かないか？", "zh": "啊，对了，刚才出去的时候，发现夜空特别\n漂亮。要不要趁着休息一起去屋顶看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "65f4421b186253ffa5c7be12e8482fa96fc45ae45226de7a2a307b111cc2d499", "ja": "いいですねぇ。\nへへっ、なんやロマンチックやなぁ！", "zh": "好啊。\n嘿嘿，怎么这么浪漫呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "656c1ad6bfb42ee10a920ccf68532ccc3acd419842bc3a05a41b294c55c3a821", "ja": "……やっぱり、今日の{$P$}さんは、\nポエマーじゃないですか？", "zh": "……今天的{$P$}先生，\n果然很像个诗人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b6d8dc3abadb348e182ef66b759d50c476e20298ed1106c6b49ca1ae2512299e", "ja": "あはは、そうかもな！", "zh": "啊哈哈，说不定还真是呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d8ae1772f06ddf782dcddf7021f33b103f6f4475b29d062df475ba03d89500b", "ja": "うわー！　綺麗やなぁ。冬は空気が澄んでるから、\nこんな都会でも星がよう見えるわ！", "zh": "哇——！好漂亮啊。冬天的空气很澄净，\n在这么繁华的都市里也能把星星看得好清楚呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "df887427ff0df9f75e9dc0301869a814f9c57af8d936d8bbeeb7c47b38c038d2", "ja": "本当ですねぇ！　むむっ！？　あれはオリオン座……。", "zh": "确实呢！　唔唔！？　那是猎户座……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "969a6783945de1398aa8d99976159702e9e437a69945d06cca43e97ee04f9b71", "ja": "こうやってじっくり星空を見てると、\nなんや曲の理解がさらに深まりそうやな。", "zh": "像这样静静欣赏星空，\n总觉得对歌曲的理解也会更加深刻呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "54c09c769afd703e35cc65d0b4453b89b03bda5be7f873da2932b81dc1c4587c", "ja": "そうですね、なんたって『夜に輝く星座のように』\nですし。……ふぁ～、きれいですぅ～。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟是《如夜空中闪耀的星座》嘛。……呼啊～真漂亮啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c727ec6fd564e06d87ec7a5a24ed1c5c3a07efa828f31a15719bffa1eabdbe95", "ja": "それにしても亜利沙が復活してくれて良かったよ。\n一時はどうなることかと思ったけど……。", "zh": "不过，亜利沙能恢复过来真是太好了。\n当时真让我担心会变成什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "13aab833c5d8027356a17b17c1aca6c6f2f09a420a82b22f4979834f6669af43", "ja": "それは奈緒ちゃんたちのおかげです！\nそれに……。", "zh": "这都多亏了奈绪她们！\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "05a4e1c6108fd2eba6ec9f638467947467584711bdde9ae6ac736807ce2e09bf", "ja": "悲しいことに違いありませんケド、アイドルちゃんとの\nお別れは、今までに経験ないわけじゃないですから。", "zh": "虽然肯定很悲伤，不过和偶像酱的分别，也不是从来没有经历过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "f63886071b0470011d56729eef48bed7f822d2d2b527b9239d4db5bab12f6ec8", "ja": "せやろな……。", "zh": "确实是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "77d0e2e030b3ad6d96aec6d2649278374f2d391ee6cfc3fb3e64c7ed64602d94", "ja": "どうしたって、避けられないものなんです。\nアイドルを推してると。", "zh": "无论如何，都是无法避免的事。\n在推偶像的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "77be5c56a9c7f354c74a2be4ac054c1b8302bbe2d4fc94581cffd216ce300f68", "ja": "でも、奈緒ちゃんたちみたいに、\n誰かが歌ってくれたり、時を超えてカバーされたり……", "zh": "不过，也有像奈绪她们那样，有人翻唱，或是跨越时代再次被翻唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "068bb544b7773f8ed5415e7ddcaec2654307c813891758b708d3aa4d48c1a54c", "ja": "SNSで取り上げられてバズったりして、\n何度も輝き直すのも見てきました。", "zh": "在社交平台上被拿出来讨论、爆火什么的，\n我也见过很多次它们重新绽放光彩的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "e48f3473406763607dbddb902a3459f304c723be8ee545f4b2927f404515c02e", "ja": "だから大丈夫。\n……大丈夫なんです。", "zh": "所以，没关系。\n……真的没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "661f3d5fb6db101b9c5590842f8bc9f6269c42f33987115a0e0729eb7f096f24", "ja": "そっか……。せやんな。夜に輝く星座のように……。\n季節が巡ったら、またいつか会えるんかもな！", "zh": "原来如此……。是啊。就像夜空中闪耀的星座一样……  \n等季节轮转，说不定哪天还能再见面呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "a79bdb493609de3991c3f6a60f98fbd6ae6b62ea7ddc6946c02a80b7cda5af87", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん……！　そうです、そうなんです！", "zh": "奈绪……！对，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "9273e3879df689d69527aaeda7cd08a2a7f2a2c35c4b8f8a612c9a26cb0487df", "ja": "星は消えることはなく、時代を超えて見上げた誰かが、\nまたその星座を見つけてくれるんです！", "zh": "星星不会消失，跨越时代仰望它的人，总会再次发现那片星座！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "3a45dd4edf91d3c9cdfc0eb3fcfc3d5ab444a7d7b1656a476bf8d9de5b50f432", "ja": "前とは違う形かもしれないけど、同じでもあって……\nあの、つまり、アイドルちゃんは永遠なんですよぉ！", "zh": "或许形式会和以前不同，但本质上又是相同的……\n那个，也就是说，偶像们是永恒的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "49d3889834bf85a7dbeb6b65d4dc8fa86d1c7dbd5b8dfafb3f0def2b34b142c3", "ja": "あはは、せやったら、私らも永遠なん？", "zh": "啊哈哈，那样的话，我们也是永恒的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_06_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "23fdff3961fe857986118bca6f4e7401022a3fd128d9f27c00c6eda7aa162389", "ja": "当たり前じゃないですかぁ！\nありさはわかりませんが、奈緒ちゃんも永遠です！", "zh": "那当然啦！\n亚利沙虽然不清楚，但奈绪也是永远的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
